LogicBBS technical notes:

Project starting date    : November 6. , 1994

First beta version       : December 12. , 1994

Manual 1st edition       :  written by Michael Pendec
                            (Manual will be rewritten, but its hard to
                            find a person with a lot of spare time doing
                            a rewrite of the *raw* manual.)

Language                 : 680x0 assembly language.

Compiler Product used    : Asm-One (revised edition)
                                   >modifications made to
                                   >the "original source by Rune G. Madsen"
                                   >new working title "Cross-Asm"

Source code size         : 1.400Kilo Bytes (around 56.500 lines)

Approx. working hours    : ca. 900 hours (give or take a few)


Computer equipment used  : A1200 with 8megabyte 32-bit expansion memory.
                           SuperVGA monitor (running DBLPAL screenmode)
                           SupraFAXmodem 14.4K
                           COMPAQ PROLINEA 486 DX2 66Mhz

                           A4000 /30 (33Mhz) with 700Meg HD,
                                             18Megs of 32-bit ram.
                                             5 phone lines.
                                             Using GVP serial cards.
                                             1*USRobotics Sportster
                                             2*SupraFAXmodem 28.8K
                                             2*Smartlink 19.2K

                           A1200 /30 (50Mhz) with 530M HD, 10Meg 32-bit ram.
                            with a USRobotics 28.8K dual standard.

                           A4000 /40 (25Mhz) (Used for testing of
                                              Enforcer hits!)

                           A4000 /30 (25Mhz) with 850Mb HD,
                                             6Mb of ram.
                                             3 phone lines.
                                             Using GVP serial cards.
                                             2*USRobotics V34 DUAL STANDARD
                                             1*USRobotics 21.6K DUAL STANDARD.
